OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in 'targeted' attack
OL,4,Anamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who died after being attacked in
OL,7,Fwhat police have called a "targeted"
OL,8,Fincident has been named by police.
OL,10,FRahiem Jackson, 38, was attacked by
OL,11,Ffour people armed with weapons outside
OL,12,Fa property in New Wortley, Leeds, on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FIn a statement issued through West
OL,16,FYorkshire Police, his family said he
OL,17,Fhad a "beautiful heart and soul",
OL,18,Fadding: "His smile was so infectious,
OL,19,Fand he lit up the room with his
OL,20,Fpresence."
